WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.340
Hey, I'm Paul Anthony Kelly,

00:00:01.341 --> 00:00:03.860
and we are at the Dior ready to wear fashion show

00:00:03.861 --> 00:00:06.660
in this beautiful Lily pad garden

00:00:06.661 --> 00:00:08.220
What's your first ever memory?

00:00:08.221 --> 00:00:10.460
Wow, starting off with the heavy hitters

00:00:10.461 --> 00:00:13.540
I have a very distinct memory of Disneyland as a child

00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:15.740
Riding in the teacups and the fireworks,

00:00:15.741 --> 00:00:18.900
And I heard that you like reading fantasy books?

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:19.620
I do, yeah.

00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:20.340
What's your favourite fantasy?

00:00:20.341 --> 00:00:21.340
I mean, Lord of the rings,

00:00:21.341 --> 00:00:22.680
The Silmarillion, anything

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:24.500
Uh, J R R

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:26.180
Tolkien, incredible 

00:00:26.181 --> 00:00:27.780
Do Androids Dream of Electric Sheep? 

00:00:27.781 --> 00:00:29.760
Philip K. Dick, incredible 

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.620
What was your first job?

00:00:31.621 --> 00:00:32.180
Oh, my gosh,

00:00:32.181 --> 00:00:33.100
My first job, well

00:00:33.101 --> 00:00:35.720
I worked for my dad as a landscaper

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.000
That was my first job
